      "text": "OM controller:\n-> call GetAppDBConfig() for\n   connection string + TLS/CA config\n-> write result into Primary OM's\n   own fixed connection-string secret\n-> establish watch on the CR itself\n-> mark internal AppDB status as Disabled",
